[38;5;231m⏺[39m Added a checkbox task item to [38;5;153mindex.html:19-22[39m:

  - [38;5;153m<input type="checkbox">[39m paired with a [38;5;153m<label for=...>[39m, so clicking the text toggles it too.
  - Checked state renders as strikethrough + grey via [38;5;153minput:checked + label[39m, so the on/off state needs no JavaScript.
  - [38;5;153m.task[39m is a flex row, so additional items follow the same markup pattern (unique [38;5;153mid[39m/[38;5;153mfor[39m per item).

  State is not persisted across reloads — say the word if you want that, or a way to add items dynamically. No tests
  run; the repo has no test setup.

